<#64a0ff>STARMINE SETTER</>
Set a Starmine (forward)		^X
Set a Starmine (ground)		_D^X
Set a Starmine (air, below)		^X
  A Starmine hits once when set. Press X again while one
  is out to blow it up: it hits again and you can cancel
  into a special. Getting hit makes her Starmines vanish.
Starmine Bomber (500, air too)		_D_DB_B^X
  Sets a Large Starmine. Detonates the old one first.
Burst Mode (1 bar)		^A_+^X
  Meter drains while it lasts. Starmines become large and
  blow up on their own. Supers cost any meter, and Lv1
  supers cancel into Lv2/Lv3. Works while blocking too.
  When it ends she gains no meter for 10 seconds.

<#64a0ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab (air too)		^Y
  Hold back to throw the other way.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash / Back Hop		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash (air)		_F_F / _B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#64a0ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Axe Kick		_B^C
Launcher (jump cancel on hit)		_DF^C
One-Two-Three		_F^A^B^C
  Then Sweep (_F^C) or Rider (_B^C), or cancel into the
  Launcher.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#64a0ff>SPECIALS</>
  The C versions cost half a bar and work while blocking.
Magic Draw		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Aoko Moonsault		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Browning Starbow		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#64a0ff>SUPERS</>
Magic Draw Edge (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Aoko Moonsault Edge (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Severe Break (2 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B_+^C
  Becomes Severe Break Slider in Burst Mode.
Retroflow - Genesis Light Year (3)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
